                    {
                        "form_id": "ec3b6a78-09b8-42bb-92c1-a2629ca76c65",
                        "entry_id": "eeea0d03-a255-37f3-ae5c-edf0572f5670",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "axed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                        "entry_id": "eeea0d03-a255-37f3-ae5c-edf0572f5670",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of ask."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative",
                            "dialectal",
                            "nonstandard"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c8891c5-1510-44d7-ade7-bcd66117f971",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "When they were come togedder, they axed off hym, sayinge: Master wilt thou at this tyme restore agayne the kyngdom of israhel?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80a1832d-814f-42b5-bdb0-c3b54971d767",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "Dolly: And if so be, why did you ax me to keep you company? Housekeeper wants me below to pick raisins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3151d01-19fd-4714-81c6-ec4434618cb7",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "Ar try who'l ax em the hardest riddle,\nAr soonest vind out oone put us, true..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc92da59-3a3f-4ac8-b8b1-a6718adef87d",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "Richard Dauntless: \"But, axin' your pardon, miss, might I be permitted to salute the flag I'm a-goin' to sail under?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40ed0213-943c-4787-a78b-5e3cde0eab9c",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "‘I axed him if he knowed the way and he said he had not fergitten the lay of the land.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1dae014-fc43-4611-9685-394c49b10d0b",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "Wise: Your boy left here a while ago\nJohnson: I ain' lookin' for him. He at his granmother's. I wanted to ax you somethin'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bf675aa-cd95-4d5e-8f15-db8c36295f95",
                                "sense_id": "22127ef6-95df-3729-9f8e-72cc864f812f",
                                "text": "He's cool. Does triathlons dahn de Sahn. Don't drink. Ax me if I want a lift to de beach — he hurd it's a dahnce goin on dahn thurr."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
